OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere'll be
OL,6,Fsome bright weather to end the day,
OL,7,Fmainly further south. Cloudier further
OL,8,Fnorth, this gradually spread south
OL,9,Fthrough the region overnight with a
OL,10,Ffew showers possibly breaking out.
OL,11,FClear spells redeveloping by the early
OL,12,Fhours.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FThursday will be a fresher
OL,15,Fday than recently. Some patchy loud at
OL,16,Ffirst will break up to give sunny
OL,17,Fspells during the day, although the
OL,18,Fodd light shower is possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
