OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLargely
OL,6,Fdry on Friday and during the weekend.
OL,7,FThough remaining a little cooler and
OL,8,Ffresher, there will be some warm
OL,9,Fspells of sunshine at times, but an
OL,10,Fisolated shower possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
